# App configuration (optional)
# The redirect URI is derived from the current origin. Set this only if you need a
# different origin during local development, e.g. when the dev server runs elsewhere.
# Note: Spotify accepts http redirect URIs only for loopback addresses (127.0.0.1),
# not for the name "localhost". The dev server binds to 127.0.0.1 for that reason.
# VITE_APP_URL=http://127.0.0.1:3000

# No API keys or secrets are needed.
# The Spotify Client ID is entered directly in the app on the "Setup" page
# and is stored in the browser's localStorage.
# Authentication uses OAuth 2.0 with PKCE - no client secret required.
#
# IMPORTANT (since February 2026): Spotify requires a Premium account for
# developer apps in Development Mode - for the developer and for every user of
# the app - and allows at most 5 authorised users per app. See README.md.
